==Miscellaneous==
*Added 2 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**10,500 grants 1 Elder [[Catfruit]].
**11,000 grants 1 Rare Ticket.
*Added [[Leadership]] feature, replacing instant [[Cat Energy|energy]] refills.
*The [[Cat Cannon]] can now be chosen directly from the Equip menu.
*The [[Officers' Club]] icon can now be changed.
*[[Treasure]] Chance Up/[[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] appearance: clicking the notification will bring you to the stage in question.
*[[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] and his assistants returning from an expedition can now be skipped.
*Added 2 new [[Gamatoto Expedition]] areas: [[Gamatoto Expedition#List of Areas|MEGABANK]] and [[Gamatoto Expedition#List of Areas|Hidden Armory]]

